 [W('Report foran zero hai','The report is still zero'),W('Tag Assistant mein event nazar aaya, Google Ads report foran update nahi hui.','Tag Assistant shows an event, but the Ads report has not updated immediately.'),[W('Foran saari campaigns delete karo','Immediately delete all campaigns'),W('Har 2 minute mein naya tag publish karo','Publish a new tag every two minutes'),W('Payload, status, attribution aur reporting delay check karo','Check payload, status, attribution and reporting delay')],2,W('Event firing aur attributed conversion reporting same cheez nahi. Current diagnostics aur official troubleshooting guide follow karo.','Event firing and attributed conversion reporting are different. Follow current diagnostics and official troubleshooting guidance.'),W('Tracking status aur next review time record karo.','Record tracking status and a next review time.')]
